    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "The Spirit Door",
      "text": [
        "A **Spirit Door** is a gateway frame for your camp: two posts, a lintel and a lamp. You walk straight through the middle; the lintel and lamp are spirit and never stop you.",
        "Set it facing the way you want the path to run. It gives off a soft light, so it marks the way in after dark."
      ]
